0\\le x\\le \\sqrt[3]{y}},\n$$\n\nas shown in the diagram below.\n\n![](images/82/8243a8c60e4b8b4846d330a00a090d6f93f94f17323c1d0a88d486ba77745451.png)\n\nTherefore, swapping the order of integration, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{x}^{3}}^{1}\\frac{3{x}^{5}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{6}+{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{y}}\\frac{3{x}^{5}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{6}+{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{y}}\\frac{3{x}^{5}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{6}+{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}3{[\\frac{2}{6}\\sqrt{{x}^{6}+{y}^{2}}]}_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{y}}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\sqrt{2{y}^{2}}-\\sqrt{{y}^{2}})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}y(\\sqrt{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\sqrt{2}-1)}{2}[{y}^{2}]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{2}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348539 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{\\sqrt{y}}^{1}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348539 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348539 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0a9fb692-301a-555c-ad0e-10c4d72cf132" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348604 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{\\sqrt{y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348604 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348604 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "122080a7-7feb-5643-8bf7-93193af72f6a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348669 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{y+1}^{0}{\\int }_{-1}^{1-{y}^{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348669 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348669 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1a6a76c2-d198-56fe-8b14-bc84b4037254" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348799 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{(x+2)/2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #